type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is the biggest Framer template I have ever made!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"So happy to finally put this in front of the community! \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Test the Live Demo\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://span.framer.ai\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", I'm sure you'll find it interesting.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":18,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":8},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-14T12:59:17.718Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-16T15:40:44.920Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-14T12:59:17.714Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"template\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":\"149\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://contra.com/payment-link/sujEyxTy-spantm-ai-saa-s-launch-system-framer-template-full-version\",\"remixUrl\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://span.framer.ai/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":26,\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Startup\",\"slug\":\"startup\"}],\"styles\":[],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Layout Templates\",\"slug\":\"layout-templates\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Vector Sets\",\"slug\":\"vector-sets\"}]}},\"index\":1}]\n5f:T54d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransform your creative portfolio into a stunning macOS experience.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis isn't just another portfolio template, it's a meticulously crafted digital workspace that brings the elegance and simplicity of Apple's design language to your personal brand. Perfect for creative directors, brand designers, photographers, and visual artists who want to stand out with a portfolio that feels as premium as their work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes MakOS different:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eInteractive resume experience\u003c/strong\u003e - Your CV isn't buried in a PDF. It lives in a beautifully designed, scannable interface that reads like Apple Notes meets LinkedIn\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eModular project showcase\u003c/strong\u003e — Flexible gallery layouts to present case studies, photography, branding work, or any creative output. Each project tells its story\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003ePerformance-obsessed\u003c/strong\u003e — Lightweight, fast-loading, and optimized. Built following Apple's own performance principles\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Directors • Brand Designers • Art Directors • Visual Designers • UI/UX Designers • Graphic Designers • Photographers • Illustrators • Motion Designers • Creative Consultants • Freelance Creatives • Agency Founders • Design Leaders • Portfolio Sites • Personal Branding\u003c/p\u003e59:[\"$\",\"$L56\",\"60415\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"60415\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"MakOS\",\"body\":\"$5f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Creative Portfolio Template\",\"slug\":\"makos\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e6c9a8a0-7715-42a8-899d-11cd4ea65607\",\"name\":\"Immerse Studio\",\"slug\":\"immerse-studio\",\"avatar\":null,\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-yxHkLR4rTEmuGVwtLxP5E2IfTjFJaO\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-dZAHo1B08CuqMsFRI6m5lNziA6iSSf\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-Wu2pqrdRcBlH8Qw6LIOQGWKLHskJEv\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c9fc8-3982-7dd0-b9fd-f0c87e85c6e5\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":2051,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":24},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-11T13:06:31.593Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-20T23:27:39.658Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-02-27T15:47:05.218Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":\"2026-06-01T14:46:12.987Z\",\"type\":\"template\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":\"https://framer.link/hdrGwUN\",\"remixUrl\":\"https://framer.link/hdrGwUN\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://makos.framer.website/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":244,\"name\":\"Personal Blog\",\"slug\":\"personal-blog\"},{\"id\":218,\"name\":\"Free\",\"slug\":\"free-website-templates\"}],\"styles\":[{\"id\":247,\"name\":\"Professional\",\"slug\":\"professional\"},{\"id\":236,\"name\":\"Light\",\"slug\":\"light\"},{\"id\":109,\"name\":\"Modern\",\"slug\":\"modern\"},{\"id\":111,\"name\":\"Minimal\",\"slug\":\"minimal\"},{\"id\":193,\"name\":\"Black \u0026 White\",\"slug\":\"black-and-white\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Overlays \u0026 Modals\",\"slug\":\"overlays-modals\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"}]}},\"index\":2}]\n60:T7bf,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://try-nocturna.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive site →\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNocturna is a Framer marketing template for SaaS products of any kind — analytics, dev tools, fintech, productivity, infrastructure, whatever you\u0026#39;re building. Dark, monospace, built to feel technical and serious rather than soft and illustrative.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes Nocturna different\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA full site, not just a landing page — 11 pages and 5 CMS collections covering product, pricing, blog, and legal, everything a SaaS company needs to launch\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete pricing system: monthly/annual toggle with a savings callout, three pricing cards, and a full comparison table so buyers can check every plan detail before they commit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered blog, team, and legal pages — Privacy Policy, Terms of Service, and Cookie Policy content lives in the CMS, so updates never touch the design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete customization guide included inside the Framer project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI setup prompts included — generate content with your AI of choice, with automatic population available for supported tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome — hero, product walkthrough, how it works, testimonials, pricing, FAQ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct — six feature blocks, each with an image and caption\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing — plan comparison table plus a billing FAQ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout — company story, animated stats, team\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact — inquiry form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog — CMS-powered post grid\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy, Terms of Service, Cookie Policy, 404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAny SaaS product that needs a complete marketing site with pricing, blog, and legal pages already built, and wants the whole thing to read as technical and serious rather than soft and illustrative.\u003c/p\u003e5a:[\"$\",\"$L56\",\"71800\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"71800\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Nocturna\",\"body\":\"$60\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Live site →\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://try-nocturna.framer.website/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nocturna is a Framer marketing template for SaaS products of any kind — analytics, dev tools, fintech, productivity, infrastructure, whatever you're building. Dark, monospace, built to feel technical and serious rather than soft and illustrative.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What makes Nocturna different\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[